WEBVTT

00:07:59.642 --> 00:08:04.522
to convert their goats
into water and electricity.

00:08:04.813 --> 00:08:11.487
(Applause)

00:08:11.820 --> 00:08:15.616
We are now planning to add smartphones,

00:08:15.616 --> 00:08:16.742
tractors

00:08:16.742 --> 00:08:18.869
and other equipment.

00:08:20.037 --> 00:08:26.585
My hope is that we can create
a more inclusive economic system

00:08:26.585 --> 00:08:28.170
where any person

00:08:28.170 --> 00:08:34.969
or any community can use
what they grow and raise as money.